That's roughly how I tried, based on the search and hits I have got working:

```js
template:  `
  <div class="is-hits-root">
    <ul class="row">
      <li *ngFor="let hit of state.hits" class="col xl3 l4 m6 s12">
        <app-object key="{{hit.objectID}}" name="{{hit.name}}" price="{{hit.price}}" typeId="{{hit.type}}" routerLinkBase="{{ routerLinkBase }}"></app-object>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <div *ngIf="state.hits.length == 0">{{ 'offers-none' | translate }}</div>
